      <p>Design isn't just my job, my role, or something that I’m good at. Being a designer is something that I just am, it’s about the way I see the world. I'm curious by nature and I often find myself thinking about how everything around me works, and how can I make it better. Weirdly enough, this kind of correlates to the fact that I seem to have an <a href="https://www.16personalities.com/intp-personality">Assertive Logician</a> type of personality.</p>
